00:00:11.660 --> 00:00:15.200
Ram Ramanathan, Product
Manager at Google Cloud.

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:18.030
Along with me, I
have Juhyun Lee,

00:00:18.030 --> 00:00:20.990
who a software engineer in
our research organization.

00:00:20.990 --> 00:00:23.630
And also with me,
we have Lynn Urwitz,

